## Stop check / planning handoff

Stop at this decision gate. The requirement cannot be handed to implementation planning until the user selects a retry/reconciliation policy and the complete impact set is recalculated with a concrete `DEC-###`. No implementation plan, work breakdown, or repository edit is produced in this artifact.
